<p>Note: Amarillo, Kansas City, Evansville, Memphis and Baltimore/Norfolk  barley prices discontinued March 3, 1997. Notes on differentials:</p>
<p>--Effective May 27, 1997, LAG and TXG corn and soybean differentials  must be adjusted as follows: All differentials add -10 cents.</p>
